From: Benjamin Berg <benjamin.berg@intel.com>
Subject: [PATCH] AP: Guard against survey list not being initialized

Do not try to store survey information in the unusual event that the
channel's survey_list is not initialized. This can happen if regulatory
changes add new channels after the ACS scan has started.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://marc.info/?l=hostap&m=176371894322747&w=2]
Signed-off-by: Benjamin Berg <benjamin.berg@intel.com>
Reviewed-by: Andrei Otcheretianski <andrei.otcheretianski@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Michael Scott <mike@foundries.io>
---
 src/ap/drv_callbacks.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ap/drv_callbacks.c b/src/ap/drv_callbacks.c
--- a/src/ap/drv_callbacks.c
+++ b/src/ap/drv_callbacks.c
@@ -2166,6 +2166,8 @@
 			continue;
 		if (chan->flag & HOSTAPD_CHAN_DISABLED)
 			continue;
+		if (!(chan->flag & HOSTAPD_CHAN_SURVEY_LIST_INITIALIZED))
+			continue;
 
 		dl_list_del(&survey->list);
 		dl_list_add_tail(&chan->survey_list, &survey->list);
